        </h2>
        <p class="text-lg text-center text-body mb-10">
          Our strategy covers everything you need for steady, long-term growth—no shortcuts, no tricks, just results.
        </p>
        <div class="space-y-8">
          <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow flex flex-col items-center">
            <div
              class="w-10 h-10 mb-2 flex items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[#f56b2a]/10 text-[#f56b2a] text-xl font-extrabold"
            >
              1
            </div>
            <div>
              <div class="font-bold mb-1 text-heading">Audit & Local Strategy</div>
              <div class="text-body">
                We analyze your current rankings, competition, and website. You get a clear, actionable roadmap.
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow flex flex-col items-center">
            <div
              class="w-10 h-10 mb-2 flex items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[#f56b2a]/10 text-[#f56b2a] text-xl font-extrabold"
            >
              2
            </div>
            <div>
              <div class="font-bold mb-1 text-heading">On-Page SEO</div>
              <div class="text-body">
                We optimize service & location pages, technical SEO, keywords, and content for local search.
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow flex flex-col items-center">
            <div
              class="w-10 h-10 mb-2 flex items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[#f56b2a]/10 text-[#f56b2a] text-xl font-extrabold"
            >
              3
            </div>
            <div>
              <div class="font-bold mb-1 text-heading">GBP & Maps SEO</div>
              <div class="text-body">
                We boost your Google Business Profile and Map Pack rankings for high-intent local leads.
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow flex flex-col items-center">
            <div
              class="w-10 h-10 mb-2 flex items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[#f56b2a]/10 text-[#f56b2a] text-xl font-extrabold"
            >
              4
            </div>
            <div>
              <div class="font-bold mb-1 text-heading">Links & Citations</div>
              <div class="text-body">
                We earn powerful local links, clean up citations, and build your business’s trust and authority.
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow flex flex-col items-center">
            <div
              class="w-10 h-10 mb-2 flex items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[#f56b2a]/10 text-[#f56b2a] text-xl font-extrabold"
            >
              5
            </div>
            <div>
              <div class="font-bold mb-1 text-heading">Reporting & Calls</div>
              <div class="text-body">You get regular reports and strategy calls—so you always know your ROI.</div>
            </div>
          </div>
