          Simple, transparent pricing for real results. No contracts. No setup fees.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-10 items-stretch justify-center">
          <!-- Local SEO Essentials -->
          <div
            class="flex-1 bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-md border border-gray-200 px-8 pt-8 pb-6 flex flex-col items-center min-h-[480px] max-w-md mx-auto"
